  "result": "Perfect! All 167 tests pass \u2713\n\nI've successfully added voucher functionality to invoices:\n\n**Changes made:**\n\n1. **src/errors.js**: Added VOUCHER_EXISTS error code for attempting to apply multiple vouchers to a single invoice\n\n2. **src/invoices.js**:\n   - Added `applyVoucher(invoice, { code, amount })` function:\n     - Requires invoice status to be 'draft' (NOT_DRAFT error otherwise)\n     - Allows only one voucher per invoice (VOUCHER_EXISTS error if one exists)\n     - Validates amount is a positive integer (AMOUNT_INVALID)\n     - Stores voucher with code and amount\n     - Does not mutate original invoice\n   \n   - Updated `invoiceTotals()` to:\n     - Return `voucher` field (0 if no voucher applied)\n     - Calculate total = subtotal - discount + vat - voucher\n     - Clamp total to >= 0\n\n3. **test/invoices.test.js**: Added 11 new tests covering:\n   - Basic voucher application to draft invoices\n   - Error cases: NOT_DRAFT, VOUCHER_EXISTS, AMOUNT_INVALID (zero, negative, decimal)\n   - Voucher calculations with and without discounts\n   - Voucher calculations with and without VAT\n   - Invoice immutability when applying voucher\n   - Complex scenarios combining discounts, VAT, and vouchers\n\nThe voucher system allows fixed-amount discounts to be applied to draft invoices before they're issued, with proper total calculations and one-voucher-per-invoice enforcement.",
